#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:107
#, c-format
msgid "Welcome to Konqueror %1."
msgstr "Welkamen bi Konqueror %1."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:108
msgid ""
"With Konqueror you have your filesystem at your command, browsing local or "
"networked drives with equal ease. Thanks to the component technology used "
"throughout KDE, Konqueror is also a full featured, easy to use and "
"comfortable Web Browser, which you can use to explore the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Mit Konqueror hest Du diene Dateien ünner Kontroll, de lokalen un, klor, ok "
"dat Netwark. Dank an de Komponenten Technologie de bi KDE brukt warrt. "
"Butenden is dat een goot to bruken Webkieker. Dat kannst Du bruken wenn Du "
"dat Internet opdecken wullt."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:113
msgid ""
"Simply enter the Internet address (e.g. <A "
"HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>"
") of the web page you want and press Enter, or choose one of the entries in "
"your Bookmarks menu."
msgstr ""
"Giff de Internet Adress in (t.B. <A "
"HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>"
"), de Du ankieken wullt un drück denn de Ingaavtast. Du kannst ok een vun "
"dien Leestekens utwählen."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:116
msgid ""
"If you want to go back to the previous web page, press the button <IMG "
"WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp;(\"Back\") in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du trüch op de vörrige Nettsiet wullt, drück den Knopp <IMG WIDTH=16 "
"HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp;(\"Trüch\") in den Warktüüchbalken."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:119
msgid ""
"To go back to the home directory of your local filesystem press <IMG "
"WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; (\"Home\"). "
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du trüch to Dien Heimorner wullt, drück op <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 "
"SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; (\"To Huus\"). "

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:121
msgid "For more detailed documentation on Konqueror click <A HREF=\"%1\">here</A>."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du mehr över den Konqueror weten wullt, klick <A HREF=\"%1\">hier</A> "
"op."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:123
msgid ""
"<I>Tuning Tip:</I> If you want the Konqueror web browser to start faster, "
"you can turn off this information screen by clicking <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">here</A>. You can re-enable it by choosing the Help ->"
" Konqueror Introduction menu option, and then pressing Settings ->"
" Save View Profile \"Web Browsing\"."
msgstr ""
"<I>Instell Tipp:</I> Wenn Du wullt, dat dien Konqueror Webkieker gauer "
"startet, kannst Du düsse Informatschoon dör klicken an <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">düsse</A> Steed utmaken. Wenn Du Di dat man doch anners "
"överleggt hest, kiek ünner Hülp ->"
" Konqueror Inföhren Menü Optschoon un drück denn op Instellen -> "
"Ansichtenprofil sekern \"Webkieken\"."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:151
msgid ""
"Konqueror is designed to embrace and support Internet standards. The aim is "
"to fully implement the officially sanctioned standards from organizations "
"such as the W3 and OASIS, while also adding extra support for other common "
"usability features that arise as de facto standards across the Internet. "
"Along with this support, for such functions as favicons, Internet Keywords, "
"and <A HREF=\"%1\">XBEL bookmarks</A>, Konqueror also implements:"
msgstr ""
"Konqueror is schreven dat Internetstandards brukt un ünnerstütt warrn. Dat "
"Teel is een vulle Inboe vun Standards vun Organisatschonen so as W3 un "
"OASIS. Ok warrn annere Saken de man bruken kann ünnerstütt, de as een de "
"facto Standard in't Internet gifft. Dat gifft aver noch mehr, as to'n "
"Bispeel Favicons, Internetslötelwöör un <A HREF=\"%1\">XBEL "
"bookmarks</A>. Mit Konqueror gahn ok:"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:158
msgid "W E B B R O W S I N G"
msgstr "W E B K I E K E N"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:159
msgid "Supported standards"
msgstr "Standards de ünnerstütt warrn"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:160
msgid "Additional requirements*"
msgstr "Wat Du ok brukst*"

