#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:238
msgid ""
"Use Internet-Keywords and Web-Shortcuts! By typing \"gg: KDE\" one can "
"search the Internet, using Google, for the search phrase \"KDE\". There are "
"a lot of Web-Shortcuts predefined to make searching for software or looking "
"up certain words in an encyclopedia a breeze. You can even <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">create your own</A> Web-Shortcuts!"
msgstr ""
"Bruuk Internet Slötelwöör un Söökafkörten! Wenn Du \"gg: KDE\" "
"ingiffst kiekt de Nettkieker mit Google na't Woort \"KDE\". Dat gifft bannig "
"veele Söökafkörten, de dien Leven wat beter maken un Di de Arbeit "
"afnehmen. Dat best is, dat Du ok <A HREF=\"%1\">dien egene</A> "
"Söökafkörten maken kannst!"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:243
msgid ""
"Use the magnifier button <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; in the "
"toolbar to increase the font size on your web page."
msgstr ""
"Bruuk den Grötter maken Knopp <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; "
"in'n Warktüüchbalken. De Teken op de Nettsiet warrn wat grötter."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:245
msgid ""
"When you want to paste a new address into the Location toolbar you might "
"want to clear the current entry by pressing the black arrow with the white "
"cross &nbsp;<IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Du wullt en niege Adress in den Adressbalken ingeven, man dor is al wat "
"rinschreven. Wenn Du op den swatten Piel mit den witten Krüüz &nbsp;<IMG "
"WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; in'n Warktüüchbalken klickst, ward "
"dat löscht."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:249
msgid ""
"To create a link on your desktop pointing to the current page, simply drag "
"the \"Location\" label that is to the left of the Location toolbar, drop it "
"on to the desktop, and choose \"Link\"."
msgstr ""
"Du wullt en Link vun de aktuelle Siet to Dien Schrievdisch maken. Treck de "
"\"Adress\"-Beschriften, de links vun den Adressbalken is, op Dien "
"Schrievdisch un lat ehr fallen. Denn söök \"Link\" ut."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:252
msgid ""
"You can also find <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; \"Full-Screen "
"Mode\" in the Window menu. This feature is very useful for \"Talk\" sessions."
msgstr ""
"<IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\">"
" &nbsp; \"Heelscheerm-Bedriev\" kannst Du ok in dat Finstermenü finnen. Dat "
"is bannig goot för \"Talk\"."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:255
msgid ""
"Divide et impera (lat. \"Divide and conquer\") - by splitting a window into "
"two parts (e.g. Window -> <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; Split "
"View Left/Right) you can make Konqueror appear the way you like. You can "
"even load some example view-profiles (e.g. Midnight Commander), or create "
"your own ones."
msgstr ""
"Divide et impera (lat. \"Deel un herrsch!\") - wenn Du dat Finster in twee "
"Parten indeelst (t.B. Finster -> <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; "
"Ansicht opdelen links/rechts) kannst Du Konqueror so utsehn laten, wo Du "
"wullt. Du kannst ok en poor Bispeel-Ansichtprofilen (t.B. Midnight "
"Commander) laden oder sülvst niege maken."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:260
msgid ""
"Use the <A HREF=\"%1\">user-agent</A> feature if the website you are "
"visiting asks you to use a different browser (and do not forget to send a "
"complaint to the webmaster!)"
msgstr ""
"Bruuk de <A HREF=\"%1\">User-Agent</A>-Funktschoon, wenn de Nettsiet seggt, "
"dat Du en anner Nettkieker bruken schallst (un nich vergeten den Webmaster "
"to seggen, dat dat so nich geiht!)"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:263
msgid ""
"The <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; History in your SideBar "
"ensures that you can keep track of the pages you have visited recently."
msgstr ""
"Mit de <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; Vörgeschicht in'n "
"Siedenbalken sühst Du de Nettsieden, op de Du jüst ween büst."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:265
msgid "Use a caching <A HREF=\"%1\">proxy</A> to speed up your Internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Dien Internetverbinnen ward gauer, wenn Du en <A HREF=\"%1\">Proxy</A> "
"brukst."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:267
msgid ""
"Advanced users will appreciate the Konsole which you can embed into "
"Konqueror (Window -> <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; Show "
"Terminal Emulator)."
